# Committed on purpose (unlike .env, which stays local/gitignored): these are
# the anon key + project URL, safe to ship in the client bundle (protected by
# RLS, not by secrecy). Expo automatically loads .env.production for
# `expo export`/production builds, so the GitHub Pages deploy
# (.github/workflows/deploy-web.yml) picks these up with no extra CI secret
# configuration needed. See backend/README.md.
#
# The service role key must NEVER go in a file like this.

